    <title>Augusta: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/augusta-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-augusta-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Commissioners declined to adopt the proposed data center ordinance on Jul 21 and extended the moratorium 60 days. On Sep 15, 2026 they approved data center rules 6-5, ending the moratorium</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Athens-Clarke County: data center moratorium — Rescinded</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/athens-clarke-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-athens-clarke-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Moratorium adopted Dec 2025 and extended in Mar 2026. The Commission voted the week of Apr 6, 2026 to lift it and replace it with regulations: data centers are allowed in heavy industrial zones and must use closed-loop cooling</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Augusta-Richmond County: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/augusta-richmond-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-augusta-richmond-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>49-day moratorium on new data centers; excludes QTS project near Haynes Station. Extended 60 days on Jul 21 with three public hearings required before permanent ordinance. Draft ordinance restricts data centers to heavy industrial zoning, requires special exception and public ... Ended Sep 15, 2026, when commissioners approved data center rules 6-5.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Roswell: data center moratorium — Expired</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/roswell-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-roswell-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>90-day emergency moratorium enacted unanimously Jan 12. Extended 95 days on Mar 23 (to Jun 26), then extended 90 days on Jun 22 (to Sep 20 2026). Council approved a UDC amendment regulating data centers on Aug 10, 2026; no further extension found.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Rockdale County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/rockdale-county-ga</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-rockdale-county-ga</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>180-day moratorium on data center and battery energy storage applications, later extended. When adopting its new UDO the board deferred the data center section to Oct 6 and extended the moratorium through Oct 9, 2026.</description>
  </item>
